{"id":56089,"date":"2026-08-01T06:28:48","date_gmt":"2026-08-01T05:28:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-corrida-ano-novo-2\/"},"modified":"2026-09-29T10:46:01","modified_gmt":"2026-09-29T09:46:01","slug":"grande-corrida-ano-novo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-corrida-ano-novo\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Corrida Ano Novo 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Corrida Ano Novo 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Grande Corrida de Ano Novo 2027<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de domingo, <strong>3 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, marcando o arranque do calend\u00e1rio de atletismo na capital. Com partida e chegada na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio<\/strong> em <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>, o evento convida milhares de atletas a inaugurar o novo ano com energia positiva e supera\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica num dos cen\u00e1rios urbanos mais deslumbrantes da Europa.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O percurso monumental atravessa pontos ic\u00f3nicos da Baixa Pombalina e da frente ribeirinha, incluindo a Rua da Prata, Rossio, Restauradores, Rua do Carmo, Chiado e Avenida Ribeira das Naus. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o oferece a competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong>, a <strong>Mini-Corrida \/ Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> e a <strong>Kids Race de 400m<\/strong> para crian\u00e7as, assegurando abastecimentos, t-shirt comemorativa, medalha e grande festa desportiva.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px sol